# Polestar Experimental, Riverglades for the Horde, part 3 of 4 (2026-11-12). Hand-written from players'
# recordings of the zone and Forever's quest data for titles, levels, objectives and places.
# Order: south-east from Bolder'ok to Powderfuse Port (the neutral goblin port) and its loops: the murlocs
# south-west, back through the port, the crawlers and Trapclaw north of it, the Eastsea pirates north-east (levels
# 38-43); the port; the pirates' second wave (43-45) and Captain Bentcoin's camp; the port; the pirates' ships and
# Admiral Lamora on the north-eastern cliffs, with Argo's mushrooms on the ridge west of them; the port.
# Offered only after another quest is handed in (players' recordings): Smuggler's Paradise after The Goblin Trader;
# It Takes Guts after Terrors From the Deep; the second wave after Unfriendly Competition; Smuggler's Special after
# Smuggler's Paradise; Smuggler's Bargain after Smuggler's Special; See Ya, Scallywags! and Admiral Lamora after the
# second wave's first two; The Monster Surfaces after It Takes Guts.
# Elites, each behind a group choice: Old Rot-Chum (42).
# Left out on purpose:
# - Shipping and Handling (95296) and I Know a Guy (95295): Friz's errands end in Tanaris and Booty Bay, and the
#   second one sends you back here.
# - Not My Circus (95982): ten Briny Seafood Stews, a cook's make; 2 of 25 recorded players handed it in.

step Powderfuse Port
  tip Experimental route (alpha): if a step is wrong, tell us on Polestar's Discord or GitHub and name the step.
  tip South-east down out of the hills to Powderfuse Port, the goblins' harbour on the coast. Friz Frazzlespark keeps a stall at the west end of the docks, Fimbo Greasemitz cooks by the inn, and Wharfmaster Whizzbuzz works the north pier.
  turnin 93976                          -- Friz Frazzlespark: The Goblin Trader
  accept 95288                          -- Smuggler's Paradise
  accept 95121                          -- Fimbo Greasemitz: A Taste of the Sea
  accept 95254                          -- The WANTED! poster by the inn: Trapclaw
  accept 95118                          -- Wharfmaster Whizzbuzz: Saltwater Savages
  accept 95119                          -- Unfriendly Competition

step WANTED: Old Rot-Chum
  when group 95120
  tip Old Rot-Chum is an elite (level 42) on the south shore: grouping up is advised.
  accept 95120                          -- The WANTED! poster by the inn

step The murlocs, south-west
  tip South-west along the shore from the port: the saltwater murlocs camp on the beaches. On the way, a painted hide is stretched beside the path: it starts Terrors From the Deep for Argo Brinewhistle at the docks.
  accept 95260                          -- Painted Hide: Terrors From the Deep
  collect 268344 x12 quest 95121.1      -- Saltwater Murloc Eye
  kill 256801 x8 quest 95118.1          -- Murloc Warrior
  kill 255898 x8 quest 95118.2          -- Murloc Oracle

step Old Rot-Chum
  when group 95120
  collect 268341 quest 95120.1 @77.4,72.3  -- Rot-Covered Harpoon

step Back through the port
  tip Back north along the shore: hand in the murlocs and the hide on the docks on your way to the crawlers.
  turnin 95118                          -- Wharfmaster Whizzbuzz
  turnin 95260                          -- Argo Brinewhistle
  accept 95261                          -- It Takes Guts: the beasts' entrails come as you go; the mushrooms grow on the ridge west of the pirates

step Beast Entrails as you go
  along until argo
  background
  tip Most beasts in the Riverglades drop Beast Entrails for Argo: the shore crawlers on this coast and the boars on the ridge west of the pirates.
  collect 268632 x15 quest 95261.1      -- Beast Entrails

step The crawlers and Trapclaw
  tip North along the beach from the docks: the crawlers drop the meat for Fimbo, and their entrails count for Argo. Trapclaw, a big crab, scuttles along the rocks east of the docks. Gul'gash, a rare elite of level 49, roams this coast from the docks up to the pirates' camp: if you see him, keep well away.
  collect 268345 x6 quest 95121.2       -- Sand Crawler Meat
  collect 268586 quest 95254.1          -- Trapclaw's Pincer

step The Eastsea pirates
  tip North-east along the coast to the pirates' camp on the cliffs. The buccaneers and musketeers carry the smuggled goods. Gul'gash walks the camp too: keep an eye out for him.
  kill 257901 x10 quest 95119.1         -- Eastsea Buccaneer
  kill 257910 x10 quest 95119.2         -- Eastsea Musketeer
  collect 268796 x8 quest 95288.1       -- Smuggled Goods

step Powderfuse Port
  tip Back to the port, from the north pier west through the docks.
  turnin 95119                          -- Wharfmaster Whizzbuzz
  accept 95122                          -- Unchecked Expansion
  accept 95123                          -- A Blast Ye Scurvy Dogs!
  turnin 95254                          -- Fimbo Greasemitz
  turnin 95121
  turnin 95288                          -- Friz Frazzlespark
  accept 95293                          -- Smuggler's Special: for Captain Bentcoin at the pirates' camp

step Wharfmaster Whizzbuzz
  when onquest 95120
  turnin 95120

step The pirates' second wave
  tip North along the coast from the port: the Eastsea raiders and bombardiers have dug in on the slopes west of the buccaneers' camp, among their powder kegs. They are level 44-45, a few levels above you here: pull them one at a time. Watch for Gul'gash on these cliffs.
  kill 257915 x8 quest 95122.1          -- Eastsea Raider
  kill 257916 x8 quest 95122.2 @79.1,33.8  -- Eastsea Bombardier
  collect 268346 x5 quest 95123.1       -- Eastsea Powder Keg

step Captain Bentcoin
  tip East along the cliffs to the far end of the pirates' camp: Captain Bentcoin waits by the water, Captain Haynes beside him.
  turnin 95293                          -- Captain Bentcoin
  accept 95294                          -- Captain Haynes: Smuggler's Bargain

step Powderfuse Port
  tip Back to the port.
  turnin 95122                          -- Wharfmaster Whizzbuzz
  turnin 95123
  accept 95165                          -- See Ya, Scallywags!
  accept 95124                          -- Admiral Lamora
  turnin 95294                          -- Friz Frazzlespark

step The pirates' ships
  tip Out to the pirates' cliffs once more. Plant Whizzbuzz's charges on the three ships moored below the camp, south to north; Admiral Lamora (level 45) stands by the middle one, with her loot chest beside her. Keep an eye out for Gul'gash on the way.
  use 268505 quest 95165.3 @90.9,39.5   -- Remote Explosive Charge, the southern ship
  kill 257861 quest 95124.1             -- Admiral Lamora
  collect 268506 quest 95124.2          -- Lamora's Loot
  use 268505 quest 95165.2 @90.6,29.6   -- the middle ship
  use 268505 quest 95165.1 @88.3,25.8   -- the northern ship

step Rotflesh Mushrooms
  tip West from the northern ship, up the ridge: the Rotflesh Mushrooms grow among the rocks, close to the Twilight ogres' camp. The Mature Paletusks on the ridge give entrails too.
  collect 268664 x8 quest 95261.2       -- Rotflesh Mushroom

step Finish the Beast Entrails
  when !has 268632 x15
  tip South-east back towards the port: the shore crawlers on the beach north of the docks are the quickest entrails. Gul'gash wanders down to this beach too.
  collect 268632 x15 quest 95261.1 @78.7,49.8  -- Beast Entrails

step Powderfuse Port
  label argo
  tip Down to the port.
  turnin 95165                          -- Wharfmaster Whizzbuzz
  turnin 95124
  turnin 95261                          -- Argo Brinewhistle
  accept 95267 optional                 -- The Monster Surfaces: a big beast in the shallows south-west of the port, near Old Rot-Chum, the elite

step The Monster Surfaces
  when onquest 95267
  tip The Monstrous Threshadon prowls the shallows south-west of the port, below the murlocs' beaches. Old Rot-Chum, an elite, walks the shore close by: give him room.
  collect 268633 quest 95267.1          -- Sea Monster's Head

step Argo Brinewhistle
  when onquest 95267
  turnin 95267
